      "defects": [
        {
          "what": "an ADULT whose email is not verified signs in with a password and is told \"We couldn’t confirm your account’s guardian approval. Please try again.\" — the guardian is not the blocker (the server's /guardian/state says required:false, not-required, eligible:false because emailVerified:false), and the card offers no way to verify the email, so the student is stuck",
          "where": "client/src/components/onboardingAuthority.js decideOnboardingAuthority (an unverified adult returns \"unavailable\") → SignUpFlow.jsx finish() shows signup.consentCheckUnavailable",
          "repro": "POST /v1/account/register {isAdult:true} (as Settings → Cloud account does), then on a new device: \"Sign in with password\" on the card, class 10, Continue",
          "lane": "L2 (account/activation logic) with L3 (card copy)"
        }
      ],
      "blocked": [
        "email-code sign-up cannot finish: the six-digit code goes to a mailbox this harness cannot read (no test inbox: the inbox file does not exist). Closes with the owner's test inbox file."
      ]
